    "resolution_evidence": null,
    "equivalence_margin": 1.1,
    "equivalence_rationale": "A 10% equivalence margin, carried unchanged into the confirmatory addendum so the pilot's own decisions are computed under the rule the confirmation uses. Pilot cells never yield a pass; the margin exists here only to make the pilot's recorded decisions comparable.",
    "material_gap_threshold": 1.2,
    "material_gap_rationale": "A 20% whole-consumer wall-clock gap is the smallest gap between two arms of this operation that is worth attributing to a named cause (representation conversion, permutation-table traffic, or codegen level) rather than to host noise on this shared eight-worker machine. The pilot exists to check that this threshold sits above the measured resolution before the confirmatory addendum freezes it."
  },
